ta\":[{\"text\":\"Up to {solo_agent_parallel_limit} concurrent cloud tasks in {work_name}\"}],\"tipsWhenTTP\":\"This feature is currently unavailable in your region. We’re working to expand availability.\"}]},\"4\":{\"context\":{},\"lines\":[{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"${basic_usage_limit} usage \\u002F month\"},{\"text\":\" ({pro_usage_multiplier}× Pro)\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Up to {solo_agent_parallel_limit} concurrent cloud tasks in {work_name}\"}],\"tipsWhenTTP\":\"This feature is currently unavailable in your region. We’re working to expand availability.\"}]},\"6\":{\"context\":{},\"lines\":[{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"${basic_usage_limit} usage \\u002F month\"},{\"text\":\" ({pro_usage_multiplier}× Pro)\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Model early access\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Up to {solo_agent_parallel_limit} concurrent cloud tasks in {work_name}\"}],\"tipsWhenTTP\":\"This feature is currently unavailable in your region. We’re working to expand availability.\"}]},\"8\":{\"context\":{},\"lines\":[{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Auto + all models\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"${basic_usage_limit} usage \\u002F month\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Unlimited Autocomplete\"}]},{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Up to {solo_agent_parallel_limit} concurrent cloud tasks in {work_name}\"}],\"tipsWhenTTP\":\"This feature is currently unavailable in your region. We’re working to expand availability.\"}]}}},\"questionAnswer\":{\"en\":[{\"q\":\"What is Usage?\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Usage is the dollar-denominated balance included in your plan, consumed as you make AI requests. For paid plans, it refreshes at the start of each subscription period. For free users, it's a one-time allowance and doesn't reset monthly.\"}]}},{\"q\":\"How is usage calculated?\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Every AI request is billed by the number of tokens processed. TRAE converts that token cost into Usage and deducts it from your balance. Once your included Usage runs out, upgrade to a higher plan for more.\"}]}},{\"q\":\"Do different models consume usage differently?\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Yes. Models have different compute costs, so the Usage per request depends on the model, prompt complexity, and context size.\"}]}},{\"q\":\"What happens if an AI request fails?\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"If the failure is on TRAE's or the model provider's side, no Usage is deducted. If the model already produced a complete response but delivery failed due to a local network or device interruption, the Usage may still be charged.\"}]}},{\"q\":\"Can I request a refund?\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"If you bought a subscription within the last 24 hours and haven't used any Usage, you can request a refund at feedback@mail.trae.ai. Refunds aren't available for used services or for expired or renewed periods.\"}]}}],\"ja\":[{\"q\":\"Usage とは何ですか？\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Usage はプランに含まれるドル建ての残高で、AI リクエストに応じて消費されます。有料プランでは各サブスク期間の開始時にリセットされ、無料ユーザーは一度限りの付与で毎月リセットされません。\"}]}},{\"q\":\"使用量はどのように計算されますか？\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"すべての AI リクエストは処理トークン数に基づいて課金されます。TRAE はそのトークンコストを Usage に換算し、残高から差し引きます。プランの Usage を使い切ったら、上位プランにアップグレードすると追加できます。\"}]}},{\"q\":\"モデルによって使用量の消費は異なりますか？\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"はい。モデルごとに計算コストが異なるため、1リクエストあたりの Usage はモデル・プロンプトの複雑さ・コンテキストサイズによって変わります。\"}]}},{\"q\":\"AI リクエストが失敗した場合はどうなりますか？\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"失敗が TRAE またはモデル提供者側に起因する場合、Usage は差し引かれません。モデルが完全な応答を生成済みで、ローカルのネットワークやデバイスの中断で配信に失敗した場合は、Usage が課金されることがあります。\"}]}},{\"q\":\"返金を申請できますか？\",\"a\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"24時間以内に購入し、Usage をまったく消費していない場合は、feedback@mail.trae.ai へメールで返金を申請できます。利用済みのサービス、または期限切れ・更新済みの期間は返金対象外です。\"}]}}]},\"modelExplain\":{\"en\":{\"premium\":{\"delta\":[{\"text\":\"Including Gemini-2.5-Pro \\u002F GPT-4.1 \\u002F GPT-4o \\u002F DeepSeek-V3-0324 \\u002F DeepSeek-V3 \\u002F DeepSeek-Reasoner(R1). \"},{\"props\":{\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdocs.trae.ai\\u002Fide\\u002Fbilling\"}},\"text\":\"Learn more\"}]},\"advanced\":{\"del